Abstract = {Rural spontaneous urbanization is an inevitable trend of urbanization to
   adapt to the market economy. Many villages in China have already had
   conditions for spontaneous urbanization, but the development of rural
   spontaneous urbanization has encountered some confusion. Based on the
   survey in S town's eight villages in Hejin area, this paper shows the
   confusion in five aspects in the process of the rural spontaneous
   urbanization, and then provides a brief analysis. Finally, this article
   draws the conclusion: government guidance is the only way to develop the
