   Eh. Results showed that glucose contributed to the mobilization of As
   and Fe, and As in the sediment from Jianghan Plain was released more
   easily. It was found that Bacillus cereus changed the pH and Eh in the
   surroundings, and promoted the reductive dissolution of As(V) and
   Fe(III) in the sediments to enhance As in groundwater.},
