Abstract = {This review examines the main events, pressures and constraints in the
   evolution of air quality policy over the past 50 years. At the start of
   that period, there was little explicit recognition of air quality
   monitoring, modelling, control or policy; currently, the emphasis is on
   targets with implementation underpinned by legislation. The European
