Note = {International Symposium on Sustainable-Development-of-City-Group,
   Changsha, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 16, 2009},
Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {Based on philosophical theory of the harmony between the heaven and
   human and centered in the love of all the things in nature, Confucianism
   formed its own eco-ethical thought. It claims that the supplies should
   be gained in accordance with the laws of nature, emphasizes on an
   abstemious access to nature and against the genocidal acts of sabotage.
   Confucian Ecological Ethics arises from humanity's misfortune, reflects
   the harmony between moral and ecological ethics and highlights the
   dominant position of human in the protection of the balance between
   nature and ecology. It provides us a useful theoretical reference to
   correctly understand and handle the relationship between man and nature,
   and to build a resource-conserving and environment-friendly society. It
   teaches us that we must cherish life and protect the ecology, respect
   nature and act according to its law, and save resources to improve
   resource utilization.},
