Note = {International Forum on Energy, Environment Science and Materials
   (IFEESM), Shenzhen, PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP 25-26, 2015},
Abstract = {This paper conducts a study on the detection method of common
   antibiotics ofloxacin(OFL) in different water. With high performance
   liquid chromatography-diode array detector(HPLC-DAD) as the detecting
   method, the chromatographic detection condition and pretreatment method
   of the samples are in the study range. The chromatographic detection
   condition includes DAD detection wavelength, the type of mobile phase
   and flow rate; the pretreatment method study includes the two parts of
   simple filtering with direct injection and water sample distillation.
   The experiment result shows that the linearly dependent coefficient of
   the external standard curve is 0.996, the detection limit is 0.025
   mg.L-1, the recovery rate of the four water samples is 101.0\%-122.8\%.},
