Abstract = {Energy-saving reconstructing for the existing buildings has great
   significance in energy-saving and protecting environment. The existing
   buildings in Yangzhou are chosen to research on the possibility of
   energy-saving reconstruction by analyzing its climate conditions,
   environment and thermal property. The energy-saving targets and
   energy-saving reconstruction measures were proposed according to
   structural types and residual service life. And the software
   PBECA20081.00 was used to calculate the indices of energy-saving
   reconstruction. The results show the total energy-saving ratio can reach
   65\%similar to 85\%, and the cost of energy-saving reconstruction is
   150-600 Yuan per square meter, which prove the energy-saving
   reconstructing for the existing buildings is a new way to go for
   building saving energy.},
