Number = {A-B},
Pages = {1739-1743},
Note = {International Symposium on Safety Science and Technology, Beijing,
   PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP 24-27, 2008},
Abstract = {In this paper, the influence of windows was analyzed on thermal
   ventilation in workshop. The influence was also numerically simulated by
   k-epsilon turbulance model and CFD software. In designing natural
   ventilation, to coordinate the dimensiom, between the inlet and owlet
   openings and to play down the neutral plane properly may be the
   effective measures to increase ventilation efficiency. In supervising
   ventilation, the cooperation should be intensified between the inlet
   windows, the upper-side windows and elerestories in order that airflow
   short-circuit, may be avoided, The simulation results was verified by
   ventilation reform practice. The windows were reconstructed to improve
   ventilation. After ventilation reform, the temperature falls 3.3-5.7
   degrees C in the working region. The hot environment of the workshop has
   been greatly improved.},
