Abstract = {This work investigated dissolution of goethite with pre-adsorbed
   arsenate (As(V); As-goethite) by phytate and its effect on As uptake by
   As-hyperaccumulator P. vittata. The results showed that phytate promoted
   As-goethite dissolution, thus enhanced plant growth. In addition, while
   inorganic phosphorus (P-i) decreased As uptake, organic phytate
   increased As uptake by P vittata.},
