   Realities of the Contemporary World (PSIWORLD), Fac Psychol \& Educ Sci,
   Bucharest, ROMANIA, OCT 27-30, 2011},
Organization = {Romanian Soc Appl Expt Psychol},
Abstract = {The psychomotor education of children with a mental disability has an
   important place in educational therapy, the mental deficiency being
   generally associated with motor dysfunctions. As a consequence, the
   disorders that may occur in the psychomotor field are more pronounced as
   the degree of deficiency is more profound.
   We believe that the most important issue here is the objective knowledge
   of the mental deficiency level, concerning psychomotor aspects which
   will improve new recovery methods and strategies, leading finally to the
   development of a very effective therapeutic program. (C) 2012 Published
